      "docs": [
        "Write her bucketed traits INTO the private TraitsSession \u2014 runs inside the enclave,",
        "owner-signed. BINDS them to the commitment root: recomputes keccak(salt\u2016traits) and",
        "requires it to equal the root the phone published at init. Traits that don't match",
        "what she confirmed are rejected, so no one (agent or server) can substitute them."
